{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028405001:1":{"text":"음... 이 나무들은 요 며칠 사이에 벤 거예요. 톱밥도 있고, 새로 벤 흔적도 있어요.","source_cn":"嗯……这些树都是这几天砍掉的，痕迹很新，还有木屑呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3D3415E01460A56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028405002:1":{"text":"톱 자국을 보면 우리가 자주 사용하는 벌목 도구가 맞아. 정말 채집대가 나무를 전부 벤 걸까?","source_cn":"看这锯痕，确实像是我们常用的伐木工具。难道真的是那支采...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CE4DAE80013823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028405003:2":{"text":"어? 이 그루터기는 조금 이상한 것 같은데...","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1028405003":{"text":"어? 이 그루터기는 조금 이상한 것 같은데...","source_cn":"咦，这些树桩看起来有些奇怪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F6A447126BB8AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028405004:1":{"text":"부패요?! 제가 좀 볼게요!","source_cn":"腐化？！请让我看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EF8CE030865064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028405005:1":{"text":"... 벤 나무에 부패의 흔적이 있긴 한데, 그렇게 심각하진 않아요. 이상하네...","source_cn":"……这些被砍伐的树确实有腐化的迹象，但看起来都不严重。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FD2A7EB564BAD98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028405006:1":{"text":"뭐가 이상한 거죠? 지금 숲 곳곳이 부패됐잖아요!","source_cn":"哪里奇怪？现在丛林里到处都是腐化！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB469938051C0F5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028405007:1":{"text":"타란 마을 북쪽은 부패가 매우 심각하지만, 이곳은 방금 시작된 것처럼 심하지 않아...","source_cn":"塔兰村北腐化得那么严重，这里的迹象却很轻微，像是刚刚开...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BC9DF050E63ED14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028405008:1":{"text":"이건 나중에 얘기하고 우선 채집대부터 찾아보죠!","source_cn":"这个稍后再讨论吧，当务之急还是先找到那支采集队才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x348895BC99608D74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"이건... 부패에 오염된 흔적이야.","source_cn":"这是……腐化污染的痕迹","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x27C96C39757BFF4F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건... 부패에 오염된 흔적이야.","female":"이건... 부패에 오염된 흔적이야.","variant_male_record_index":"61366","variant_female_record_index":"61367","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","docu